IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FUZZ.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INDEX PIC 9 VALUE 0.
01 WS-RESULT PIC 9 VALUE 0.
01 WS-GOTO-SWITCH PIC 9 VALUE 0.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
CONTINUE.

PARAGRAPH-A.
MOVE 1 TO WS-INDEX
GO TO PARAGRAPH-B DEPENDING ON WS-INDEX
DISPLAY "UNREACHABLE A"
STOP RUN.

PARAGRAPH-B.
MOVE 2 TO WS-RESULT
IF WS-INDEX = 1
   DISPLAY "JUMPED FROM A WITH INDEX 1"
ELSE
   DISPLAY "ERROR: INDEX WAS NOT 1"
END-IF
MOVE 0 TO WS-GOTO-SWITCH
GO TO PARAGRAPH-C DEPENDING ON WS-GOTO-SWITCH
DISPLAY "UNREACHABLE B"
STOP RUN.

PARAGRAPH-C.
ADD WS-RESULT TO WS-RESULT
DISPLAY "FINAL RESULT " WS-RESULT
MOVE 1 TO WS-GOTO-SWITCH
GO TO MAIN-PARA DEPENDING ON WS-GOTO-SWITCH
DISPLAY "UNREACHABLE C"
STOP RUN.
